msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Hoʻopaʻa kī / KWallet Wehe-Aunoa"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻā i ka hōʻoia maka e wehe ʻakomi i kāu kī hoʻopaʻa inoa a i ʻole "
"KWallet ma ke komo ʻana. Mālama kēia i kāu ʻōlelo huna i hoʻopaʻa ʻia "
"ma ka TPM ke loaʻa, a i ʻole i hoʻopili ʻia me AES-256-GCM me ka hoʻoh"
"ana ʻana i kahi kī kumu kumu-wale nō. Hoʻonohonoho ʻia ke alo o ka man"
"a PAM_AUTHTOK no pam_gnome_keyring a i ʻole pam_kwallet5 ma muli o kāu"
" pākaukau."

